import-mensuration-mens-l012 12. the height and the base radius of a solid right circular cone are \(36\) cm and \(15\) cm respectively. the circular cone is divided into three parts by two planes which are parallel to its base. the heights of the three parts are equal. express, in terms of \(\pi\),

(a) the volume of the middle part of the circular cone;

(b) the curved surface area of the middle part of the circular cone.
(6 marks) 12. 一個實心直立圓錐的高及底半徑分別為 \(36\) cm 及 \(15\) cm。該圓錐被兩個平行於底面的平面分成三部分,三部分的高度相等。以 \(\pi\) 表示:

(a) 圓錐中間部分的體積;

(b) 圓錐中間部分的曲面面積。
(6 分) dse 2020 p1 q12 來源所列(未獨立核實):dse 2020 p1 q12 subtract similar cones or pyramids / 相似錐體相減
